# Moving groups in the history (an extension). The arrows after a
# group's name in the group list move it one place; Edit > Move Group
# Earlier and Later move the active group. A move that would put a group
# ahead of a group it uses is refused, naming both, and is no undo step.
load thread/bolt_m8x30.slvs
tw
# The head can't go before the sketch it extrudes.
answer ok
twmove 235 160
twdown L 235 160
twup L 235 160
# The shank sketch needs only the references: up, past the head.
twmove 307 180
twdown L 307 180
twup L 307 180
tw
# The shank can't go after the thread blank, which is drawn on it.
answer ok
twmove 262 200
twdown L 262 200
twup L 262 200
# Nor the thread, the active group, before its profile; and it is last.
answer ok
menu Features|Move Group Earlier
answer ok
menu Features|Move Group Later
# Undo takes the one move back, and redo does it again.
key z ctrl
tw
key y ctrl
tw
dump
